---
source: crates/web/src/tests.rs
expression: "readable(&f, &page.body)"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="htmx-config" content="{&quot;includeIndicatorStyles&quot;:false,&quot;allowEval&quot;:false,&quot;allowScriptTags&quot;:false}">
<title>Ignore by title · sanic-review</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css">
<script src="/assets/htmx.min.js" defer>
</script>
<script src="/assets/app.js" defer>
</script>
</head>
<body data-page="confirm" hx-headers="{&quot;x-csrf-token&quot;:&quot;<token>&quot;}">
<header class="topbar">
<a class="home" href="/">sanic-review</a>
<span class="counts" id="counts">
<b>0</b> queued · <b>0</b> running · <b class="cnt">3</b> pending drafts <span class="muted-sep">|</span> <span class="k">?</span> keys</span>
</header>
<main>
<h1>Ignore by title</h1>
<p class="meta">
<a class="gh" href="https://github.com/org/repo/pull/8">https://github.com/org/repo/pull/8</a> by bob</p>
<h2>Title</h2>
<pre class="title">Fix &lt;script&gt; escaping</pre>
<details class="description" open>
<summary>Description</summary>
<pre>Fix &lt;script&gt; escaping, in detail.</pre>
</details>
<form id="confirm" method="post" action="/pr/org/repo/8/ignore" data-resend>
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<token>">
<p>
<label for="pattern">Pattern </label>
<span class="dim">A glob over whole titles, ignoring case; only glob syntax is special. Edit it down, e.g. to <code>build(deps)*</code>.</span>
</p>
<input id="pattern" type="text" name="pattern" value="Fix &lt;script&gt; escaping" size="60" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" hx-get="/pr/org/repo/8/ignore/preview" hx-trigger="input changed delay:150ms" hx-include="[name='profile']:checked" hx-sync="#confirm:replace" hx-target="#matches" hx-swap="outerHTML">
<div id="matches">
<h2>Would skip (1)</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<a class="gh" href="https://github.com/org/repo/pull/8">https://github.com/org/repo/pull/8</a> Fix &lt;script&gt; escaping</li>
</ul>
</div>
<fieldset>
<legend>Add it to skip_titles in</legend>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="profile" value="" checked hx-get="/pr/org/repo/8/ignore/preview" hx-trigger="change" hx-include="#pattern" hx-sync="#confirm:replace" hx-target="#matches" hx-swap="outerHTML"> <code>[review_requests]</code>: every profile</label>
<br>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="profile" value="default" hx-get="/pr/org/repo/8/ignore/preview" hx-trigger="change" hx-include="#pattern" hx-sync="#confirm:replace" hx-target="#matches" hx-swap="outerHTML"> <code>[profile.default]</code>
</label>
<br>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="profile" value="vuln" hx-get="/pr/org/repo/8/ignore/preview" hx-trigger="change" hx-include="#pattern" hx-sync="#confirm:replace" hx-target="#matches" hx-swap="outerHTML"> <code>[profile.vuln]</code>
</label>
</fieldset>
<button type="submit">
<kbd>y</kbd> Save to the config</button> <a id="cancel" href="/pr/org/repo/8">
<kbd>Esc</kbd> Cancel</a>
</form>
</main>
<div class="overlay" id="help" hidden>
<div class="popup">
<h2>Keys</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>q</kbd>
</th>
<td>close this help; otherwise back to the index</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>Tab, Shift-Tab</kbd>
</th>
<td>next, previous list</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>j/k, Down/Up</kbd>
</th>
<td>move in the list</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>g/G, Home/End</kbd>
</th>
<td>first, last row</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>Enter</kbd>
</th>
<td>open the selected PR</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>r</kbd>
</th>
<td>review now: failed, held or skipped (asks first)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>x</kbd>
</th>
<td>archive or unarchive the selected PR</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>X</kbd>
</th>
<td>show or hide archived PRs</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>i</kbd>
</th>
<td>skip PRs with titles like the selected one</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>v</kbd>
</th>
<td>who reviewed the selected PR, and when; Esc closes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>d</kbd>
</th>
<td>the selected PR's review run and drafts; Esc closes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>c</kbd>
</th>
<td>chat with the agent that reviewed it: shows the command</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>f</kbd>
</th>
<td>on a PR page: the drafts, or the files changed with the drafts in them</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>
<kbd>?, Esc</kbd>
</th>
<td>show, close this help</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="dim">On a PR page j/k move between drafts, and r and a act on the PR. On a confirm page y confirms and Esc or q cancels.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="overlay" id="dialog" hidden>
<div class="popup dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
</div>
</div>
<div id="notice" hidden>
</div>
</body>
</html>
